concept:communications-legislation-amendment-information-sharing-and-datacasting-act-2007-sec-3-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedule(s)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3-2 ;
    values:originalText "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule    Communications Legislation Amendment (Information Sharing and Datacasting) Act 2007 No. 178, 2007            3 concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
