concept:communications-legislation-amendment-information-sharing-and-datacasting-act-2007-sch-1-sec-59a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "59A Disclosure to Ministers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-59a ;
    values:originalText "(1) An ACMA official may disclose authorised disclosure information to the Minister.  (2) An ACMA official may disclose to a Minister authorised disclosure information that relates to a matter arising under a provision of an Act that is administered by that Minister.  (3) Subsection (2) does not limit subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An ACMA official may disclose authorised disclosure information to the Minister.  (2) An ACMA official may disclose to a Minister authorised disclosure information that relates to a matter arising under a provision of an Act that is administered by that Minister.  (3) Subsection (2) does not limit subsection (1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7704bdd05014b52ca8b3659aea579b16a4f7fb5736923698af872c9b341eaecd" ;
